ns02:zenodo.22676379 a crm:E73_Information_Object,
        crmdig:D1_Digital_Object,
        dcat:Dataset,
        fdo:3DDataFDO ;
    dct:created "2024-06-12"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:creator ns11:2424425c3325db08 ;
    dct:description """Low resolution model of St. Lachtain's well in Freshford. The flower decorations were not there at my last few visits. A lady in the village told me that the water is supposed to heal sores. I would not recommend trying that, especially after the hedgehog has been floating in there for a while.

Wikidata: Q121840779

SMR no: KK013-025----

Made in KiriEngine from 156 images.""" ;
