    dct:created "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:creator ns06:0000-0002-3246-3531 ;
    dct:description "Photogrammetric 3D scan (KIRI Engine) of a white stepped LEGO pyramid (nine levels) with a five-brick column and a minifigure-style warrior figure on top (spiked helmet, mail shirt, tunic, cloak), a hobby build by Florian Thiery; scanned on 2026-11-12 in the Apothekertrakt of Schönbrunn Palace, Vienna, where the model was on display during the CHNT31 conference. Raw scan without clean-up. The paired reconstruction is a separate FDOx and derives from this one." ;
    dct:isReferencedBy ns02:zenodo.24305343 ;
    dct:issued "2026-11-17"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:license <http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>,
        ns011:CC-BY-4.0.html ;
    dct:provenance "KIRI Engine export (GLB, AdvancedExport; a second OBJ export exists). 135,616 triangles and 68,248 vertices after merging duplicate vertices; not watertight; no clean-up applied." ;
