    schema:author "Florian Thiery" ;
    schema:datePublished "2026-11-17" ;
    schema:description "Idealised reconstruction of a white stepped LEGO pyramid (nine levels) with a five-brick column and a minifigure-style warrior figure on top (spiked helmet, mail shirt, tunic, cloak), a hobby build by Florian Thiery, rebuilt procedurally from clean LEGO bricks after a KIRI Engine scan. Only dimensions and structure were read from the scan; no scan mesh or texture was reused. AI disclosure: the reconstruction was generated with Claude (Anthropic, claude-sonnet-5-5) on behalf of Florian Thiery. It is an interpretation model, not a measurement." ;
    schema:identifier "10.5281/zenodo.24305343" ;
